### Inventory Value
Name: Inventory_Value

```dax
Inventory_Value = SUM(fact_inventory[stock_level])
```
Format: Whole number

Description: Shows the total available inventory stock level.

Dependencies / Notes:
- If stock value (monetary) is needed, replace with unit_price * stock_level.

