### Order Quantity
Name: Order_QTY

```dax
Order_QTY = SUM(fact_procurement[order_quantity])
```
Format: Whole number

Description: Calculates the total quantity ordered from procurement activities.

Dependencies / Notes:
- Uses fact_procurement[order_quantity].

---

### Perfect Order %
Name: Perfect Order %

```dax
Perfect Order % =
VAR perfectOrder =
    CALCULATE(
        [Total_Shipment],
        fact_shipment[status] = "Delivered",
        fact_production[defect_rate_pct] < 1
    )
RETURN
DIVIDE(perfectOrder, [Total_Shipment])
```
Format: Percentage

Description: Percentage of orders completed successfully without delivery issues or production defects.

Dependencies / Notes:
- Depends on [Total_Shipment] measure and fields fact_shipment[status], fact_production[defect_rate_pct].

