### Profit
Name: Profit

```dax
Profit = SUM(fact_sales[profit])
```
Format: Currency

Description: Calculates the total profit generated from sales.

Dependencies / Notes:
- Uses fact_sales[profit]. Ensure profit is stored per transaction.

