### Profit Margin %
Name: Profit Margin %

```dax
Profit Margin % = DIVIDE([Profit],[Total_Revenue])
```
Format: Percentage

Description: Profit as a percentage of total revenue.

Dependencies / Notes:
- Depends on [Profit] and [Total_Revenue].

