### Shipment Cost
Name: Shipment_cost

```dax
Shipment_cost = SUM(fact_shipment[shipping_cost])
```
Format: Currency

Description: Total shipping and transportation cost.

Dependencies / Notes:
- Uses fact_shipment[shipping_cost]. Consider splitting by carrier or shipment type if needed.

