### Total Delay
Name: Total_Delay

```dax
Total_Delay =
CALCULATE(
    [Total_Shipment],
    fact_shipment[status] = "Delayed"
)
```
Format: Whole number

Description: Counts the number of delayed shipments.

Dependencies / Notes:
- Relies on [Total_Shipment] and fact_shipment[status] values.

---

### Total Delivered Quantity
Name: Total_Delivered_Quantity

```dax
Total_Delivered_Quantity =
CALCULATE(
    [Total_Sales_Quantity],
    fact_shipment[status] = ""
)
```
Format: Whole number

Description: Calculates the quantity delivered based on shipment status (original model used empty-string filter). Review the filter condition — it may need to match a specific status like "Delivered".

Dependencies / Notes:
- Check the status values in fact_shipment; adjust the filter to the intended value.

---

