### Total Shipment
Name: Total_Shipment

```dax
Total_Shipment = DISTINCTCOUNT(fact_shipment[shipment_id])
```
Format: Whole number

Description: Counts the total number of unique shipments.

Dependencies / Notes:
- Ensure shipment_id is unique per shipment.

---

### Total Shipment Quantity
Name: Total_Shipment_Quantity

```dax
Total_Shipment_Quantity = SUM(fact_shipment[quantity])
```
Format: Whole number

Description: Total quantity included in shipments.

Dependencies / Notes:
- Uses fact_shipment[quantity].

---

### Turnover Rate
Name: Turnover_Rate

```dax
Turnover_Rate =
DIVIDE(
    [Total_Sales_Quantity],
    AVERAGE(fact_inventory[stock_level])
)
```
Format: Decimal number

Description: Measures how efficiently inventory is being sold and replaced (sales quantity divided by average stock level).

Dependencies / Notes:
- Uses [Total_Sales_Quantity] and fact_inventory[stock_level].

